    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers in excess of 849,000\n\nAn exceptional architect-designed residence set on a low-maintenance site in a highly sought-after location approximately 3km from Wexford Town Centre.\n\nExtending to approximately 177 sq m, this superb A-rated home is presented in immaculate, turnkey condition and offers an impressive standard of finish throughout. Thoughtfully designed with modern living in mind, the property features a bespoke, beautifully appointed kitchen, luxurious bathroom suites, elegant interiors and a wonderful sense of style and quality throughout.\n\nThe low-maintenance exterior further enhances the appeal of this exceptional home, providing an ideal balance of sophistication, comfort and practicality. The location is equally impressive; the property is within easy walking distance of Kaat Strand and the River Slaney, while the renowned Curracloe Beach is less than a 10-minute drive away. Wexford Town, with its extensive range of shops, restaurants, cafés, schools and amenities, is also conveniently close by.\n\nRarely does a home of this calibre, combining architectural design, A-rated energy efficiency, exceptional finishes and such a desirable coastal setting, come to the market. A truly unique opportunity to acquire a distinctive contemporary residence, ready for immediate occupation. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith tiled flooring, recessed lighting\n\nLiving Room - 3.5m x 4.1m\nwith herringbone wood flooring, French doors to hallway\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.9m x 4.4m\nwith wood flooring. fitted sliderobes, wardrobe space\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m x 3.6m\nwith wood flooring, fitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.3m x 3.8m\ntiled with feature walk in shower, large stand-alone bath, electric mirror unit, vanity unit\n\nBedroom 3 (Master) - 3.4m x 3.8m\nwith wood flooring\n\nEn-Suite - 2.0m x 2.9m\ntiling, walk in shower, WC, Double WHB, vanity unit\n\nWalk-in Robe - 2.1m x 2.9m\nwith wood flooring, fitted units, pull out drawers\n\nHopress - 2.3m x 3.1m\nwith tiled flooring, pressurised tank, shelving\n\nKitchen / Dining/ Living - 4.7m x 9.1m\nOpen plan layout, bespoke fited kitchen, feature island, quartz countertops, fitted appliances, tiled flooring, large sliding door to patio area\n\nPantry - 1.4m x 2.3m\nwith double doors, sensored lighting, generous shelving\n\nUtility Room - 2.3m x 2.9m\nwith tiled flooring, fitted units, plumbed, access to side\n\nToilet - 1.5m x 2.3m\nfully tiled, WC, WHB, vanity unit\n\nOUTSIDE - \nElectric gated entrance & gravel drivewayPatio area to side with pedestrian gateDetached shed to the rearFully walled perimeterLow maintenace plot\n\n"
